{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_lumen_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lumen_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"直到燈火明亮","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lumen_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7bf7d8eb1bc50679922b208940ee32438a40d8d9106a917fe4c0c987739a64f3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"流明答應替受傷的信使遞送包裹，這件包裹卻給寂靜的格蘭法洛帶來了一些波瀾。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“出於安全性考慮，介面裝置能夠採用的......現有的最佳替代材料......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這個預估材料消耗的數量級，是不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不對，這些是早期的筆記，如果她弄錯了，她一定會劃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......“伊比利亞之眼”，該有多大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，如果它亮起來的話，從格蘭法洛的每一扇窗戶向外望，都能看到它的燈光......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這個應該是傳說吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後是照明強度測試......圖示這麼清晰，總覺得照著就能做出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，小鎮上好像沒有能做出試驗品的材料......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等一下！我這就來開門！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的護工手忙腳亂地將筆記本塞進雜物櫃，提起手邊的燈，快步穿過禮拜堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間已經很晚了，請問您來禮拜堂有什麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——信、信使先生？！您怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別著急，我扶您進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您先在門口躺一下，我新洗過的紗布就在旁邊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"門......先關上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......整齊的刀傷，連著硬質皮帶一起砍斷了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，我應該有辦法處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過您需要在這裡多養幾天傷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......逃過一劫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是啊，您來得很及時，畢竟我能做的很少，如果傷口感染了的話，就沒辦法了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你真奇怪，連我是怎麼受傷的都不問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，住在這座小鎮的傢伙都這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我只是覺得當務之急是為您止血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您突然這麼問，我也不知道怎麼回答。這座小鎮之外是什麼樣子，我其實不太瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記憶裡，很少有外地人到格蘭法洛來，離開的人，也不再回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"格蘭法洛......就是這樣的地方啊。離海很近，離審判庭也很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是這樣，就連您這樣的信使也不太停留......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我還不知道您的名字。信使們每次急匆匆地來，接著又急匆匆地走，一般不會有空來禮拜堂歇腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......咳，對了，你應該對格蘭法洛很熟悉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想還算熟悉？我一直在這裡生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，很久以前發生的事、廣場、廣場上的雕像，還有大海......那些我只聽叔叔說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那也夠多啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真不好意思，你幫我療傷，已經是幫了我很大的忙了......但是，我還有別的事情得拜託你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這個包裹是送到格蘭法洛的，不過沒有具體的地址和收件人姓名，只寫了“插著白花的門扉”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"插著白花？我不記得鎮上有這樣的人家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我很清楚自己的傷勢，這幾天恐怕不方便在小鎮裡四處走動，尋找這個收件人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這個包裹......只有送出去了我才能安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒問題，交給我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，等天亮了我就去找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我再拿兩條毯子來。雖然東西都是舊的，但您一定能溫暖地過夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......要小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年輕人，真是越來越不謹慎了！再這樣下去，審判庭的人遲早要被他們引來，把這二十年的平靜都毀了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勸我冷靜點講道理......審判庭的那幫傢伙什麼時候講過道理？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，剩下的湯都是你的了，孩子。太鹹了，我不愛喝......你也是，最近尤其要小心，別讓人注意到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，蒂亞戈叔叔，下次我煮湯一定注意......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鎮上出什麼事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，只是又有多管閒事的傢伙來格蘭法洛四處打探了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，兩個只知道向審判庭打報告的教士，不知道是嗅著什麼味道來了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蘭法洛絕對沒有他們想要的東西，他們難道看不出來嗎？......這裡已經什麼都沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......禮拜堂那邊有什麼事嗎？你還在看你父母留下的筆記？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......讀起來還挺有趣的，不知不覺一天就過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓其他人看到你在讀那些筆記，我記得他們是用阿戈爾語做的記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，蒂亞戈叔叔。我會小心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初我只是想，把它們藏在最危險的地方，也許反而不會被審判庭查到。我只是想，不能讓那幫匪徒帶走格蘭法洛的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於有沒有人會看，我沒想過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這些資料能當作你打發時間的消遣，那也值了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔，您能把這些東西保留下來，我真的很感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，今天晚上禮拜堂來了一個——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門外的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈，我們有事得跟你報告！我們必須在審判庭盯上格蘭法洛之前把這事處理了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（壓低聲音）喬迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我明白......！我先去房間裡，把門關上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們搞清楚了，那兩個教士在追的是信使，不是我們鎮上的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但麻煩就麻煩在，他們懷疑信使在替一些阿戈爾人傳遞消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，別擺那種臉色，蒂亞戈，你知道不是我們要懷疑阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我們剛剛去過禮拜堂了。那個信使被教士打傷了，在禮拜堂休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......禮拜堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，我們有意等喬迪離開禮拜堂，才把教士帶去那裡。誰都沒說喬迪的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們跟他關係這麼好，怎麼可能讓他被這種莫名其妙的事情牽連進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，那個信使把他所有的行李都交給教士檢查了，裡面沒有任何可疑的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這事多半又是......一場誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，誤會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情況我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，讓大家都安分守己地過幾天日子，誰也別提這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要......我們都低著頭忍耐一陣子，這事就可以當作沒發生過，審判庭不會再來打擾我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我去通知其他人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人寄出的，可疑的東西，呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喬迪抱起門後用墨綠絨布層層包住的物件，貼上去聞了聞。\n他不確定那種會令蒂亞戈叔叔皺眉的鹹味，究竟是來自手中的包裹，還是來自格蘭法洛四季不變的潮濕空氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自己去找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上的人都很善良，我不覺得他們會做什麼需要被抓走的壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈叔叔說過，很多年前，格蘭法洛還住著不少阿戈爾人。也許只是有人不知道自己的朋友已經離開了，才把東西寄了過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......自己去看看收件人是誰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......廣場東邊的街區都走過一遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天清晨再出來找其他地方吧。按照蒂亞戈叔叔的說法，那兩位教士早晨七點就會四處巡視了，我得趕快回家才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，已經三天了，教士們應該也準備離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“插著白花的門扉”......可是絕大多數人的屋子都已經漆成了白色，應該不會喜歡用白花裝飾吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，剛剛路過的那幢房子，門上好像有什麼白色的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好像看錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是花，而是......掛著一本書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......是不是有點奇怪？我記得這裡應該很久沒人住了，但這本書是新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我敲門試試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......似乎沒有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，還是沒有人應答，我應該是想太多了吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我順著這條街往上走，你去另一邊看看，看到不對勁的就踹門進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個小鎮應該只有這附近我們沒查過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒聽過的聲音，口音也很陌生......應該就是那兩位外來的教士了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我得躲起來！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（從這裡往回走，不知道會不會與他們撞上。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要是我真的被發現了，一定會給蒂亞戈叔叔帶去很多麻煩吧......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——腳步聲靠近了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的女性聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，年輕有為的教士。這座小鎮上很少見到您這樣的外來者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（剛剛那扇門......開了？而且，我聽過這個聲音。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢當，我的同齡人之中，已經有人躋身審判官的行列。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，您似乎比這座小鎮的大多數人更接近我們的信仰，而不是一味地恐懼審判庭的裁決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只不過是從文字中獲得過一些淺薄的知識，理解審判庭在與什麼樣的危機對抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這座小鎮裡真的存在您擔憂的東西，我建議去那個方向搜尋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您有線索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我從未見過任何異常，因此我才選擇在這座寧靜的小鎮落腳，安心做我的文書工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過大海就在那個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說只可能在鎮外......我明白了，謝謝。當然，那已經超出我們兩位普通教士的能力範圍了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，禮拜堂的喬迪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想問一下......這個是不是寄給您的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想知道裡面是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？......不，我怎麼可能懷疑您呢，阿瑪雅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在格蘭法洛，您懂的比大家都多，蒂亞戈叔叔也說，您幫他想了很多辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，進來看看吧，我希望你能心安一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近剛托人把這幢廢棄的房子收拾好，用來保存家裡放不下的書籍和文稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......或許以後有人願意來這裡坐一坐，看看格蘭法洛，乃至整個伊比利亞之外的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你捎來的包裹裡也是一些書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識這些文字嗎？都是阿戈爾語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，勉強能讀懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以這些確實是阿戈爾人寄來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你能讀懂，那就隨意翻看一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這本是在說戲劇......舞台裝置......什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本是劇院建築設計......裡面的設計圖，看起來真厲害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅小姐，您難道在研究戲劇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，我只不過是個不入流的翻譯家罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些書只是我的一位朋友在家中發現的舊物，應該是那場災難之後一些阿戈爾人憑記憶重新寫成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"災難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，她特意把這些書寄給我，希望我翻譯成伊比利亞的語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人的文字，在這個陸上國家難以保存，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這些書籍如果讓不懂阿戈爾語的教士們看到，確實會產生誤會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您聽起來這麼難過，是因為阿戈爾人的境遇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是吧......但也不止是阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我自己其實已經習慣這樣的生活了，哈哈......我覺得沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也知道，自己不能代表阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，在其他地方，阿戈爾人也是這樣生活的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他地方是什麼樣子......嗯，喬迪，既然你是這裡唯一的阿戈爾人，你願意協助我進行翻譯工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你的幫助，我就不必獨自翻查那本舊詞典了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......欸？不，我覺得自己做不了這麼艱深的文書工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，只要你想，什麼時候都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你也可以先在這裡盡情閱讀自己感興趣的書籍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文字也許偶爾會騙人，但不可否認的是，它總會打碎人們的界限，讓人看到新的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中當然也包括你好奇的外界的模樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的茶壺放在哪裡了？請坐吧，喬迪，在這裡多待一下，也許就能發現自己感興趣的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我得回禮拜堂了，受傷的信使還需要人照顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的好意，但我......我得先做好護工的工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個年輕人......他不是能夠理解的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他沒有夢見過嗎？自己有了翅膀，俯瞰著一望無際的大海，每一朵浪花都溶進水中......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪？你去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你答應過七點前回來的，孩子。我叮囑過你，不要到處亂跑，那兩名教士多半今天就會離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉，叔叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去照顧一下傷患，然後就去裡間待著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幾個年輕人幫你照看過傷患了。他們想讓你安心在家裡躲著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那我下次再跟他們道謝......今天我就躲在這裡，應該也沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，我就在這裡，關起門來點上燈看書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這盞燈......還能用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我按照筆記上說的試了一下，不知道算不算修好，但現在至少能發光了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n對不起，我沒能讓這盞燈掛在這裡......我決不允許它掛在審判庭用於監視格蘭法洛的這座禮拜堂裡。\n而且，它被摔壞了。在駐守的懲戒軍衝出禮拜堂的那個晚上之後，它就再也不亮了。\n我打算把它和你們的筆記一起放在箱子裡，如果足夠幸運，它們也許能保存下去。但我不會為此祈禱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......繼續看吧，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，信使先生，您醒過來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩位教士已經離開格蘭法洛了，您不用再這麼提心吊膽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，還有，包裹我也已經送到了。請放心，您沒有做什麼壞事，我看到了包裹裡的東西，一切都是一場誤會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉萊多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫拉萊多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，作為信使，我知道自己容易惹上麻煩，也想儘量避免更多的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我叫喬迪。我明白您的擔憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，總之，您的傷口也恢復得很好，我想這兩天您就能恢復行動自如的狀態了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，喬迪，你難道喜歡這個地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我說不上來。為什麼突然問這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡離審判庭太近，或許跟他們還有過節。在我看來，這裡充滿危險，同時被迫維持著死氣沉沉的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"對於你這個阿戈爾人來說，應該更是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經一天都不想在這裡多待了，你難道沒想過離開這裡，出去看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果是擔心出了格蘭法洛不知道往哪裡去，正好可以跟我一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"北邊無人的荒野看起來凶險，但我也知道比較安全的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我還知道幾座像樣的城市，對阿戈爾人比較寬容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣的阿戈爾人也有機會做夢，然後實現夢想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉萊多，外面的人是否更熟悉大海，您知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的人......會談論大燈塔，聊起“伊比利亞之眼”的傳說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻了，喬迪，人們不會隨便提起海。至於大燈塔，那是只有你們格蘭法洛的人才會講給自己孩子聽的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的好意，拉萊多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還不能走。不看到海和燈塔的話，我不能走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"可是格蘭法洛已經失敗了。那種黃金時代伊比利亞的幻夢，早在幾十年前就結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請別這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不只是伊比利亞的，也是阿戈爾人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一個阿戈爾人的夢想啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
